#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:2
msgid "Plugin (Custom / External)"
msgstr "插件（自定义 / 外部）"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:4
msgid ""
"Two L2 adapter types load an adapter class from a *user-supplied* Python "
"module at startup, so you can point LMCache at your own storage backend "
"without modifying LMCache source.  This is the ``--l2-adapter`` analog of"
" vLLM's ``kv_connector_module_path``."
msgstr "两种 L2 适配器类型在启动时从 *用户提供* 的 Python 模块加载适配器类，因此您可以将 LMCache 指向您自己的存储后端，而无需修改 LMCache 源代码。这是 vLLM 的 ``kv_connector_module_path`` 的 ``--l2-adapter`` 类似项。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:9
msgid ""
"``plugin``: loads a pure-Python class that implements "
"``L2AdapterInterface`` (the full L2 adapter contract)."
msgstr "``plugin``: 加载一个实现 ``L2AdapterInterface``（完整的 L2 适配器契约）的纯 Python 类。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:11
msgid ""
"``native_plugin``: loads a pybind-wrapped C++ connector exposing a six-"
"method async batch contract and wraps it in ``NativeConnectorL2Adapter``."
"  Use this for native backends -- see also "
":doc:`/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/native_connectors`."
msgstr "``native_plugin``: 加载一个 pybind 封装的 C++ 连接器，暴露一个六方法异步批处理契约，并将其包装在 ``NativeConnectorL2Adapter`` 中。请将其用于本地后端 -- 另见 :doc:`/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/native_connectors`。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:17
msgid "``plugin``"
msgstr "``plugin``"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:19
msgid ""
"Dynamically imports ``module_path`` and instantiates ``class_name``, "
"which must be a subclass of ``L2AdapterInterface`` (validated at load "
"time; a mismatch raises ``TypeError``)."
msgstr "动态导入 ``module_path`` 并实例化 ``class_name``，该类必须是 ``L2AdapterInterface`` 的子类（在加载时进行验证；不匹配会引发 ``TypeError``）。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:23
#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:67
msgid "**Required fields:**"
msgstr "**必填字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:25
msgid ""
"``module_path`` (str): Dotted Python import path of the module containing"
" the adapter class.  The module must be importable by the LMCache process"
" (installed, or on ``PYTHONPATH``)."
msgstr "``module_path`` (str): 包含适配器类的模块的点分 Python 导入路径。该模块必须可以被 LMCache 进程导入（已安装或在 ``PYTHONPATH`` 中）。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:28
msgid ""
"``class_name`` (str): Name of the class inside *module_path* that "
"implements ``L2AdapterInterface``."
msgstr "``class_name`` (str): *module_path* 中实现 ``L2AdapterInterface`` 的类的名称。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:31
#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:73
msgid "**Optional fields:**"
msgstr "**可选字段：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``adapter_params`` (dict, default ``{}``): Arbitrary dict forwarded to "
"the adapter constructor."
msgstr "``adapter_params`` (字典，默认 ``{}``): 转发给适配器构造函数的任意字典。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:35
msgid ""
"``config_class_name`` (str): Name of a config class inside *module_path* "
"that subclasses ``L2AdapterConfigBase``.  When set (or auto-discovered), "
"the factory builds it via ``from_dict(adapter_params)`` and passes the "
"config object -- instead of the raw ``adapter_params`` dict -- to the "
"adapter constructor, matching the built-in adapter convention.  Discovery"
" order when omitted: ``<class_name>Config`` in the module, then a "
"``config_class_name`` attribute on the adapter class; otherwise the raw "
"dict is passed."
msgstr "``config_class_name`` (str): 在 *module_path* 中的配置类名称，该类是 ``L2AdapterConfigBase`` 的子类。当设置（或自动发现）时，工厂通过 ``from_dict(adapter_params)`` 构建它，并将配置对象（而不是原始的 ``adapter_params`` 字典）传递给适配器构造函数，以匹配内置适配器的约定。省略时的发现顺序：模块中的 ``<class_name>Config``，然后是适配器类上的 ``config_class_name`` 属性；否则传递原始字典。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:44
#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:80
msgid "**Configuration examples:**"
msgstr "**配置示例：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:54
msgid "See ``examples/lmc_external_l2_adapter/`` for a complete reference plugin."
msgstr "请参阅 ``examples/lmc_external_l2_adapter/`` 以获取完整的参考插件。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:57
msgid "``native_plugin``"
msgstr "``native_plugin``"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:59
msgid ""
"Dynamically imports ``module_path``, instantiates ``class_name`` with "
"``adapter_params`` as constructor keyword arguments, verifies the "
"instance exposes the required async batch methods (``event_fd``, "
"``submit_batch_get``, ``submit_batch_set``, ``submit_batch_exists``, "
"``drain_completions``, ``close``), and wraps it in "
"``NativeConnectorL2Adapter``.  An optional ``submit_batch_delete`` "
"enables L2 eviction deletes; without it, deletes are a no-op (logged as a"
" warning)."
msgstr "动态导入 ``module_path``，使用 ``adapter_params`` 作为构造函数关键字参数实例化 ``class_name``，验证实例是否暴露所需的异步批处理方法（``event_fd``、``submit_batch_get``、``submit_batch_set``、``submit_batch_exists``、``drain_completions``、``close``），并将其包装在 ``NativeConnectorL2Adapter`` 中。可选的 ``submit_batch_delete`` 允许 L2 逐出删除；如果没有它，删除操作将无效（记录为警告）。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:69
msgid ""
"``module_path`` (str): Dotted Python import path of the module containing"
" the connector class."
msgstr "``module_path`` (str): 包含连接器类的模块的点分 Python 导入路径。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:71
msgid "``class_name`` (str): Name of the connector class inside *module_path*."
msgstr "``class_name`` (str): *module_path* 中连接器类的名称。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``adapter_params`` (dict, default ``{}``): Forwarded as keyword arguments"
" to the connector constructor."
msgstr "``adapter_params`` (dict, default ``{}``): 作为关键字参数传递给连接器构造函数。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:77
msgid ""
"``max_capacity_gb`` (float, default ``0``): Aggregate L2 capacity in GB "
"for usage tracking / eviction.  ``0`` disables aggregate eviction."
msgstr "``max_capacity_gb`` (float, default ``0``): 用于使用跟踪/逐出的 GB 级别的 L2 总容量。 ``0`` 禁用总逐出。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/plugin.rst:87
msgid ""
"See ``examples/lmc_external_native_connector/`` for a complete reference "
"native connector."
msgstr "请参阅 ``examples/lmc_external_native_connector/`` 以获取完整的参考本地连接器。"

